Two minutes later, we are ready to go.
(t): I can't wait to see Scarlet and find out how she got here.
The three of them lead the way to their so-called base.
(t): Whatever that may mean.
The whole way Ray keeps yapping about mundane things and Seth and I take turns giving curt answers.
I take the time to observe them more closely.
