(t): He seems like a full-fledged extrovert.
Lu appears a little more timid, almost gloomy. But he's got a certain cuteness to him.
(t): Maybe because he's a bit on the shorter side?
His black hair has a purple hue to it and the locks frame his face nicely, drawing attention to his pale eyes.
(t): What a cute little trio. Despite having such different personalities, they seem to share a really close bond. Maybe they really are family, just like Scarlet said.
Ray: Hey, we made it!
