Seth goes and opens the door.
Seth: The same goes for the boss. Come in, she's waiting.
We enter the house and head straight to the bookshelf that's taking up a whole wall.
This house seems to have only one room with the bed and kitchen all tightly squeezed in, and of course a small bathroom.
Lu pulls out one of the many books in the shelf but only halfway.
Suddenly the shelf makes a lot of clicking noises and sinks into the wall.
(t): Wait, it can't be!
