(t): It's much bigger than the living space above.
I also notice some doors that suggest that there are more rooms down here.
In the back of the room I can see a seating area and casually sitting on one of the chairs, Scarlet.
Me: Scarlet! Uh, or should I say Lady… or, maybe Miss Moon after all?
Scarlet shows a relieved smile.
