Me: Right. I'm glad to see you safe and sound. What happened?
Scarlet: I'm also glad that you seem safe. after that cloaked person dragged you into a dark portal and vanished with you, I got zapped back to the present and landed right where we fell down in my office. It didn't seem like any time passed.
She pauses.
Scarlet: But are you sure you're not hurt? let me see.
I walk over to her and let her closely inspect my body.
Me: I'm fine. I managed to escape the Spirit before anything could happen. It felt just like when we traveled back in time, I went through a starry void and somehow came back again.
Scarlet sighs.
Scarlet: That's good then.
she nods in the direction of the guys.
