Scarlet: Fine, I'll let you temporarily leave work. But you must promise me to tell me, if there's anything I can do to help.
Me: Thank you, Scarlet. I'm glad you understand.
Scarlet looks at me with a saddened expression.
Scarlet: If it's because I'm a vampire and you feel uncomfortable because of that, I understand. So please just tell me now, if that's the case.
(t): Of course not, Scarlet. Those facts could never make me hate you, not when I've seen your warm sides.
CHOICE OPTION 1: It's not like that.
